    51|/**
    52| * Classify an executive agent based on its real runtime architecture.
    53| *
    54| * Evidence used:
    55| * - Does the agent have its own process/worker entry point?
    56| * - Does it share a runtime with other agents (framework agent mapping)?
    57| * - Is it a thin role wrapper over a shared framework agent?
    58| * - Does it have a heartbeat loop?
